Package: narrate
Title: Verified Narration of Tables for Reproducible Reports
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generate the prose that accompanies a table in a reproducible
    report (R Markdown or Quarto) with a large language model via 'ellmer',
    and verify that every figure in the generated text exists in the table.
    Figures that do not are diagnosed as rounded, converted from a proportion,
    or unsourced. Includes a mode to reproduce a full periodic report from the
    previous edition and the new tables, a hash-based cache so that rendering
    never re-calls the API, and a log of every call (model, tokens, latency,
    unverified figures) for comparing models.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
